      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base">
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/news/2026/11/minister-metlege-diab-highlights-how-canada-is-working-with-provinces-and-territories-to-support-worker-retention.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Minister Metlege Diab highlights how Canada is working with provinces and territories to support worker retention (November 12, 2026), IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/corporate/immigration-system/measures.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Time-limited measure for 2027, IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/corporate/immigration-system/levels/supplementary-immigration-levels-2027-2029.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Supplementary Information for the 2027-2029 Immigration Levels Plan, IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/news/2026/11/canada-takes-action-to-efficiently-process-existing-permanent-residence-applications-for-ukrainians-and-hong-kongers.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Canada takes action to efficiently process existing permanent residence applications for Ukrainians and Hong Kongers (November 10, 2026), IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://budget.canada.ca/2026/report-rapport/chap3-en.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Budget 2026, Chapter 3, Government of Canada</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/immigrate-to-b-c/about-the-bc-provincial-nominee-program/news" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">BC PNP news (2026 allocation, August 18, 2026), WelcomeBC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/Immigrate-to-B-C/Invitations-To-Apply" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">BC PNP Invitations to Apply, WelcomeBC</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-4">Information current as of November 13, 2026. Provincial shares and B.C.'s participation had not been announced; confirm on IRCC or WelcomeBC before acting.</p>
